{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/matt-roz/YGOJSON/main/schema/v1/card.json",
  "id": "c10b0b9d-cbb8-4767-9725-9e8ae7cc84e8",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "XX-Saber Faultroll",
      "effect": "Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by controlling 2 or more \"X-Saber\" monsters. Once per turn: You can target 1 Level 4 or lower \"X-Saber\" monster in your GY; Special Summon it."
    },
    "fr": {
      "name": "Tueur de Trolls, Sabre XX",
      "effect": "Ni Invocable Normalement ni Posable Normalement. Uniquement Invocable Sp\u00e9cialement (depuis votre main) en contr\u00f4lant min. 2 monstres \"Sabre X\". Une fois par tour : vous pouvez cibler 1 monstre \"Sabre X\" de max. Niveau 4 dans votre Cimeti\u00e8re ; Invoquez-le Sp\u00e9cialement."
    },
    "de": {
      "name": "XX-S\u00e4bel-Faultroll",
      "effect": "Kann nicht als Normalbeschw\u00f6rung beschworen/gesetzt werden. Muss als Spezialbeschw\u00f6rung (von deiner Hand) beschworen werden, indem du 2 oder mehr \u201eX-S\u00e4bel\u201c-Monster kontrollierst. Einmal pro Spielzug: Du kannst 1 \u201eX-S\u00e4bel\u201c-Monster der Stufe 4 oder niedriger in deinem Friedhof w\u00e4hlen; beschw\u00f6re es als Spezialbeschw\u00f6rung."
    },
    "it": {
      "name": "Faultroll Sciabola-XX",
      "effect": "Non pu\u00f2 essere Evocato Normalmente/Posizionato. Deve essere Evocato Specialmente (dalla tua mano) controllando 2 o pi\u00f9 mostri \"Sciabola-X\". Una volta per turno: puoi scegliere come bersaglio 1 mostro \"Sciabola-X\" di Livello 4 o inferiore nel tuo Cimitero; Evocalo Specialmente."
    },
    "pt": {
      "name": "Sabre-XX Faultroll",
      "effect": "N\u00e3o pode ser Invocado por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Normal/Baixado. Deve ser Invocado por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Especial (da sua m\u00e3o) ao controlar 2 ou mais monstros \"Sabre-X\". Uma vez por turno: voc\u00ea pode escolher 1 monstro \"Sabre-X\" de N\u00edvel 4 ou menos no seu Cemit\u00e9rio; Invoque-o por Invoca\u00e7\u00e3o-Especial."
    },
    "es": {
      "name": "Sable-XX Faultroll",
      "effect": "No puede ser Invocado de Modo Normal/Colocado. Debe ser Invocado de Modo Especial (desde tu mano) controlando 2 o m\u00e1s monstruos \"Sable-X\". Una vez por turno: puedes seleccionar 1 monstruo \"Sable-X\" de Nivel 4 o menor en tu Cementerio; Inv\u00f3calo de Modo Especial."
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "\uff38\uff38\uff0d\u30bb\u30a4\u30d0\u30fc \u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30eb",
      "effect": "\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306f\u901a\u5e38\u53ec\u559a\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u3002\u81ea\u5206\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u306b\u300c\uff38\uff0d\u30bb\u30a4\u30d0\u30fc\u300d\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u304c\uff12\u4f53\u4ee5\u4e0a\u5b58\u5728\u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306e\u307f\u7279\u6b8a\u53ec\u559a\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3002\u2460\uff1a\uff11\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u306b\uff11\u5ea6\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u5893\u5730\u306e\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\uff14\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u300c\uff38\uff0d\u30bb\u30a4\u30d0\u30fc\u300d\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\uff11\u4f53\u3092\u5bfe\u8c61\u3068\u3057\u3066\u767a\u52d5\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3002\u305d\u306e\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u7279\u6b8a\u53ec\u559a\u3059\u308b\u3002"
    },
    "ko": {
      "name": "XX\uff0d\uc138\uc774\ubc84 \ud3f4\ud2b8\ub864",
      "effect": "\uc774 \uce74\ub4dc\ub294 \ud1b5\uc0c1 \uc18c\ud658\ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\ub2e4. \uc790\uc2e0 \ud544\ub4dc\uc5d0 \"X\uff0d\uc138\uc774\ubc84\" \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\uac00 2\uc7a5 \uc774\uc0c1 \uc874\uc7ac\ud560 \uacbd\uc6b0\uc5d0\ub9cc \ud2b9\uc218 \uc18c\ud658\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub2e4. \u2460: 1\ud134\uc5d0 1\ubc88, \uc790\uc2e0 \ubb18\uc9c0\uc758 \ub808\ubca8 4 \uc774\ud558\uc758 \"X\uff0d\uc138\uc774\ubc84\" \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130 1\uc7a5\uc744 \ub300\uc0c1\uc73c\ub85c \ud558\uace0 \ubc1c\ub3d9\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub2e4. \uadf8 \ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\ub97c \ud2b9\uc218 \uc18c\ud658\ud55c\ub2e4."
